WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.353
Step 1. Open Actions. Only a superuser can change or delete an action configuration.

1.2
00:00:06.353 --> 00:00:12.534
Select Admin Dashboard, then Actions under Configuration in the admin sidebar.

2.1
00:00:12.534 --> 00:00:15.406
Step 2. Open the action configuration.

2.2
00:00:15.406 --> 00:00:18.718
Select the row or the name of the configuration.

2.3
00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:22.681
Care shows who created it and who changed it last.

3.1
00:00:22.681 --> 00:00:25.819
Step 3. Change the name or the description.

3.2
00:00:25.819 --> 00:00:28.775
You can change the Name and the Description,

3.3
00:00:28.775 --> 00:00:32.129
but not Runs for or the on-demand setting.

4.1
00:00:32.129 --> 00:00:37.272
Step 4. Change an action. Select the Action 1 header to open the card,

4.2
00:00:37.272 --> 00:00:42.600
then change the conditions under When or the instructions under Then.

5.1
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.616
Step 6. Save the changes. Select Save.

5.2
00:00:45.616 --> 00:00:51.586
Care shows Action configuration updated and keeps the configuration open; new slot

5.3
00:00:51.586 --> 00:00:54.933
bookings run the changed configuration.

6.1
00:00:54.933 --> 00:00:58.003
Step 7. Delete the action configuration.

6.2
00:00:58.003 --> 00:01:01.317
Select Delete, then Delete again in the dialog.

6.3
00:01:01.317 --> 00:01:07.333
Care shows Action configuration deleted, and the configuration no longer runs.
